#: includes/admin/ajustes.php:104
msgid "Article 22a of Directive 2011/83/EU has required every shop selling goods to display the official EU notice on the legal guarantee of conformity since 27 September 2026. The plugin ships the notice exactly as the European Commission publishes it, in the 24 official EU languages, and serves the one that matches each visitor."
msgstr ""

