#: includes/admin/funciones-apg.php:96
msgid "In Spain the legal guarantee on new goods is three years from delivery, longer than the two-year European minimum stated in the notice."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/funciones-apg.php:113
msgid "Every item we sell is covered by the legal guarantee of conformity. If what you receive does not match its description, or does not work as it should, you are entitled to have it repaired or replaced free of charge, and where that is not possible, to a price reduction or a refund."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/funciones-apg.php:117
msgid "The guarantee runs for three years from delivery on new goods, as Article 120.1 of the Spanish consumer act establishes. On second-hand goods the period is the one agreed at the time of sale, and never less than one year."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/funciones-apg.php:119
msgid "The guarantee runs for at least two years from delivery. On second-hand goods the period may be shorter, and never less than one year."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/funciones-apg.php:122
msgid "To claim it, write to us with your order number and a description of the problem, along with proof of purchase such as the receipt, the invoice or a bank statement. We will tell you how to proceed and cover the cost of returning the item when it has to come back to us."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/funciones-apg.php:123
msgid "This legal guarantee applies on top of any commercial guarantee offered by us or by the producer, and is never replaced by it."
msgstr ""

